cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "gps-special-messages: pipeline, analysis, figures, and verifiers for the GPS L1 C/A Subframe 4 Page 17 corpus, 2007–2026"
abstract: >
  Code, data pipeline, analysis scripts, article figures, and claim-level
  verifiers accompanying Murdoch (2026), "The Empty Field That Wasn't:
  GPS, OTAD, and Two Decades of Encrypted Broadcasts" (Inside GNSS,
  May/June 2026). Reproduces 12,163,006 special-message observations
  across 3,994 unique payloads from the GFZ Potsdam navigation-bit
  archive, 2007-06-19 to 2026-01-23.
authors:
  - family-names: Murdoch
    given-names: Steven J.
    email: sjmurdoch@gmail.com
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/sjmurdoch/gps-special-messages"
